 "file": "EmuquTests/CloudPullRecordTests.swift",
 "hash": "ef2f0c5602289eb0",
 "role": "XCTest suite for what the pull does with each listed record (CloudPullCoordinator.processRemoteRecord) on a sync manager of the test's own over a temporary archive: a tombstone removes the local copy without the Trash, deletes nothing it does not hold, spares a session restored here and not yet uploaded, sends a copy with an unsynced change to the Trash, and when the copy cannot be removed keeps it with its bookkeeping and reports the failure; a kept-on-device record leaves the local copy; a live record is imported unless the session was deleted forever. Records are built in memory; nothing reaches iCloud.",
